  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "エネルギーが　つまった　アメ。　あたえると\nダイマックスレベルが　１あがる。レベルが\nたかいと　ダイマックスの　ＨＰが　ふえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "에너지가 가득한 사탕.\n먹이면 다이맥스 레벨이 1 올라간다.\n레벨이 높으면 HP가 늘어난다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充滿能量的糖果。\n餵給寶可夢後，能讓極巨化等級提升１級。\n當等級變高，極巨化時ＨＰ將會增加。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bonbon plein d’énergie qui fait monter le niveau\nDynamax d’un Pokémon d’un point. Plus ce dernier\nest élevé, plus les PV sous forme Dynamax augmentent.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Bonbon, das voller Energie steckt. Beim Verzehr\nsteigt der Dynamax-Level eines Pokémon um 1 Stufe an.\nDies erhöht seine KP nach der Dynamaximierung.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramelo energético que sube el nivel Dinamax de un\nPokémon. Cuanto más alto sea el nivel, más aumentarán\nsus PS al dinamaxizarse.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramella altamente energetica che aumenta di un\npunto il Livello Dynamax. Più alto è il livello, più\naumentano i PS del Pokémon quando si dynamaxizza.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it\nwill raise the Dynamax Level of a single Pokémon by\none. A higher level means higher HP when Dynamaxed.",
